! Test v1.07.0 (1/4): Fermi-Dirac smearing, closed shell, hot sigma.
! H2O HF/STO-3G, %smearing fermi, sigma = 0.10 Ha.
! Checks: fractional occupations (sum = 10 exactly), HOMO < mu < LUMO,
! -T*S < 0 (Fermi entropy is non-negative), F = E - TS variational.
! Expected (container reference, gfortran 13.3, netlib BLAS;
! re-anchored in v1.08.0; stabiliser retunes shift the stop point
! within ~5e-11 Ha of the same fixed point):
!   Smearing  -T*S:         -0.025188982163
!   Total energy (F=E-TS):  -74.966999528185
%method  HF
%basis   sto-3g
%job     energy
%smearing fermi
%smearing_sigma 0.10
*geometry angstrom
 O   0.000000    0.000000    0.117300
 H   0.000000    0.757200   -0.469200
 H   0.000000   -0.757200   -0.469200
*end
